      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_63750cdd33af7b79a096f1a8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the list of notes, __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__-click individual notes to select them. Alternatively, click on a note and then __TRILIUM_PH_2__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_3__-click a more distant note to select all the notes in between.",
      "sourceHash": "63750cdd33af7b79a096f1a8101a5d7184820fc15cccf89bc6d49f73cd472dd7",
      "context": "Evernote > Import process",
      "contextHash": "9ae2f103879ac40d68d4c5aa27ddc105116c5e90b37f6d30f37bc4204da902fc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b683421abb26f97c80a3c7c5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "At the bottom there should be a floating bar with some options. Select […] → __TRILIUM_PH_0__Export.__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "b683421abb26f97c80a3c7c59ee5e53684f3c24152edd42605bfc4b89c5ce57b",
      "context": "Evernote > Import process",
      "contextHash": "9ae2f103879ac40d68d4c5aa27ddc105116c5e90b37f6d30f37bc4204da902fc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
