    {
      "id": "u_d25ba660b9abbe1e56b3f394_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To export multiple notebooks in bulk, consider using a third-party CLI tool called __TRILIUM_PH_0__evernote-backup__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "d25ba660b9abbe1e56b3f3940b1d32b0691676e99115673183fecd14c06602b7",
      "context": "Evernote > Import process",
      "contextHash": "9ae2f103879ac40d68d4c5aa27ddc105116c5e90b37f6d30f37bc4204da902fc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c4c9525e54e415a027e5514e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once you have your ENEX files, do the following to import them in Trilium:",
      "sourceHash": "c4c9525e54e415a027e5514e8401b26874b12fab9ac08ff0e7ea46ff81a26fa7",
      "context": "Evernote > Import process",
      "contextHash": "9ae2f103879ac40d68d4c5aa27ddc105116c5e90b37f6d30f37bc4204da902fc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ef4bbe69eb52d183b3df83f2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__, right click and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Import into note__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "ef4bbe69eb52d183b3df83f21ece5d4532aff127158e9daaf171bcfa82be7c1c",
      "context": "Evernote > Import process",
      "contextHash": "9ae2f103879ac40d68d4c5aa27ddc105116c5e90b37f6d30f37bc4204da902fc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c6efddecb010d0765f48f64f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Import from__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section, select __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Evernote__TRILIUM_PH_4__.",
      "sourceHash": "c6efddecb010d0765f48f64f4c594ae9fd829c3e539fd334376434519af024e0",
      "context": "Evernote > Import process",
      "contextHash": "9ae2f103879ac40d68d4c5aa27ddc105116c5e90b37f6d30f37bc4204da902fc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4b575df058069dee7e90f65f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "During the import, you will see \"Import in progress\" message. If the import is successful, the message will change to “Import finished successfully” and then disappear.",
      "sourceHash": "4b575df058069dee7e90f65faacffce6761127af1fcf511113375a1192ec6e3b",
      "context": "Evernote > Import process",
      "contextHash": "9ae2f103879ac40d68d4c5aa27ddc105116c5e90b37f6d30f37bc4204da902fc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4ec01b175b4734481463b65f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "We recommend you to check the imported notes and their attachments to verify that you haven’t lost any data.",
      "sourceHash": "4ec01b175b4734481463b65fb7eb48944725bf81d8d7e969434266501c44110a",
      "context": "Evernote > Import process",
      "contextHash": "9ae2f103879ac40d68d4c5aa27ddc105116c5e90b37f6d30f37bc4204da902fc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
