    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3feba2dbd0d28887b22a99884dc255c7ff2e43988d",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "07b6f7b37deb0fedfd063214f449e957084316aa7c2f13dddfde5941571bc54d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6afce9615d74fbb96a39bf49_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The size limit of one import is 250Mb. If the total size of your files is larger, you can increase the __TRILIUM_PH_0__upload limit__TRILIUM_PH_1__, or divide your files, and run the import as many times as necessary.",
      "sourceHash": "6afce9615d74fbb96a39bf498e5fae20b43a0d8709d24ef15d3a6eb357358e67",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "07b6f7b37deb0fedfd063214f449e957084316aa7c2f13dddfde5941571bc54d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_67c1b8d0ed0d945081148dd9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "All resources (except for images) are created as notes’ attachments.",
      "sourceHash": "67c1b8d0ed0d945081148dd99977cfb8f8e31d8ae20d008e2bf9f7cbc366da64",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "07b6f7b37deb0fedfd063214f449e957084316aa7c2f13dddfde5941571bc54d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_367310b0ff624cb98147b546_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If you have HTML inside ENEX files, the HTML formatting may be broken or lost after import in Trilium. See __TRILIUM_PH_0__Reporting issues__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "367310b0ff624cb98147b546e8fc7b0e73121c30a2ef5af6ff7bb6f4ce20d4bb",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "07b6f7b37deb0fedfd063214f449e957084316aa7c2f13dddfde5941571bc54d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9433cbe5b1300160a9ae863e_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Links to other notes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9433cbe5b1300160a9ae863e45cebc68416f1f0476dd281755ec8d116742bcef",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes",
      "contextHash": "3fa76dd72def3f6eacceb9358b176ef52e429a7a23e0772e7173151c3e49e52f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a0e57f2eea4e869757bac2b5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since v0.104.0, the ENEX importer tries to recreate links to other notes automatically by converting their Evernote-specific URLs to Trilium's __TRILIUM_PH_0__Internal (reference) links__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "a0e57f2eea4e869757bac2b5824786b7e2175c81181a6137b3e367488b022d4d",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes",
      "contextHash": "3fa76dd72def3f6eacceb9358b176ef52e429a7a23e0772e7173151c3e49e52f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d8d766e3d80f06941c7d855d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since the ENEX format does not provide the unique ID of notes, the note references are determined via their note title.",
      "sourceHash": "d8d766e3d80f06941c7d855d5e2159d8a6b4f5a850fc683c1ed85f9b81b7e72b",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes",
      "contextHash": "3fa76dd72def3f6eacceb9358b176ef52e429a7a23e0772e7173151c3e49e52f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ae486cd949d12f3be2baf427_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Limitations:",
      "sourceHash": "ae486cd949d12f3be2baf427692d2bd60502c806d1deae5905da2ff877f97616",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes",
      "contextHash": "3fa76dd72def3f6eacceb9358b176ef52e429a7a23e0772e7173151c3e49e52f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e966668f28b025f75b50f580_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Only notes that are part of the same import will have their links rewritten to reference links, to avoid linking to the wrong note.",
      "sourceHash": "e966668f28b025f75b50f5801bfbafcefe7faff1b7f86bdbe0ea2b2d032f5775",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes",
      "contextHash": "3fa76dd72def3f6eacceb9358b176ef52e429a7a23e0772e7173151c3e49e52f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f6eacd4a06739fd01f10084e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If there are to notes with the same name, internal links will not be created to avoid pointing to the wrong note.",
      "sourceHash": "f6eacd4a06739fd01f10084e723d678815aa873e3ee7137eaa0d0e1032316fb3",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes",
      "contextHash": "3fa76dd72def3f6eacceb9358b176ef52e429a7a23e0772e7173151c3e49e52f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_81d8e5ecefca2a88155b95cd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Links that couldn't be rewritten (e.g. referring to a missing/duplicate note) will be kept with their original __TRILIUM_PH_0__ URL.",
      "sourceHash": "81d8e5ecefca2a88155b95cd53b170c9e0efa7a0a0fc223022ce67661aa94e5f",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes",
      "contextHash": "3fa76dd72def3f6eacceb9358b176ef52e429a7a23e0772e7173151c3e49e52f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9d1d082376cfdef5887afcec_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It will not fix links to anchors and links to notes that you renamed in Evernote after you created the links.",
      "sourceHash": "9d1d082376cfdef5887afcec891523186055dbdd0b86f2c47e6b8ab030bdd0f6",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes",
      "contextHash": "3fa76dd72def3f6eacceb9358b176ef52e429a7a23e0772e7173151c3e49e52f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cb31a879016a1f5d521bd92a_0",
      "kind": "h4",
      "source": "Post-processing notes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "cb31a879016a1f5d521bd92aaf6b8f1a2d6f9a2c01c5f6620fdd1dd0d43cd75b",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_75544059eaaa7c0cfce51380_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This script allows rewriting links after the import has been done, and it should also allow finding links between two different imports.",
      "sourceHash": "75544059eaaa7c0cfce51380c1d28e75b5ecad20b3fd69e22585b52ca54ea698",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b18a550e3d2152fd557212ad_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you want to restore the internal links in Trilium after you import all of your ENEX files, you can use or adapt this custom script: __TRILIUM_PH_0__Process internal links by title__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "b18a550e3d2152fd557212ad6f83a9b2a0f410a15f4632e6c6c529a84f42267f",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7e06d73f3bff9e1e3333c359_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The script does the following:",
      "sourceHash": "7e06d73f3bff9e1e3333c359155e3b7c2b4b1bda6e7b5dc9f116ab3c71b79911",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a76ff72a3b7c150db35d9f45_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It finds all Evernote internal links.",
      "sourceHash": "a76ff72a3b7c150db35d9f45d31184ef14b82f1f044dedbc53c6a92a275eee5c",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_efe543b2a7e8c81a8bfc7400_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each one, it checks if its link text matches a note title, and if yes, it replaces the Evernote link with an internal Trilium link. If not, it leaves the Evernote link in place.",
      "sourceHash": "efe543b2a7e8c81a8bfc7400d19ca6d16fafe126d750d5f63408f9ea622f5e1e",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_48136aae0a407e831a9ab7c4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If it finds more than one note with a matching note title, it leaves the Evernote link in place.",
      "sourceHash": "48136aae0a407e831a9ab7c4e78018db3d23ccd1cd2377799e891fa717b783a6",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_45007ab1d2f07d2bcfbcccae_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It outputs the results in a log that you can see in the respective code note in Trilium.",
      "sourceHash": "45007ab1d2f07d2bcfbcccaeba0f175c8125f11e9dfc3d229870b6b549bfaec7",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2b77d30064ac1ce65df632d2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The script has the following limitations:",
      "sourceHash": "2b77d30064ac1ce65df632d28e76270adf5f2b46012a2b459696415d71c25255",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9d1d082376cfdef5887afcec_1",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It will not fix links to anchors and links to notes that you renamed in Evernote after you created the links.",
      "sourceHash": "9d1d082376cfdef5887afcec891523186055dbdd0b86f2c47e6b8ab030bdd0f6",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_40f035a3ac6f40ffe68f26fd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Some note titles might not be well identified, even if they exist. This is especially the case if the note title contains some special characters. Should this be problematic, consider __TRILIUM_PH_0__Reporting issues__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "40f035a3ac6f40ffe68f26fd302137fab0da7c3e495980cd402d5ada369d747b",
      "context": "Evernote > Limitations > Links to other notes > Post-processing notes",
      "contextHash": "4f127dfc90000d151fa112885b0537a3a422635a0255a201acd531cd669fe3d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2bf2c57afc3c3752afbeaf8e_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Reporting issues__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2bf2c57afc3c3752afbeaf8e05bfb59300f5f1bf42573dc5359a53fbe63cb560",
      "context": "Evernote > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "dcfcf2808b5ee2971559adddd6e5eb1d98d7630e652566eced2b830aba3879da",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c70843a287adb9a4ad4251b9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When importing your Evernote notebooks, you might find issues in how a note is imported; in that case consider __TRILIUM_PH_0__reporting__TRILIUM_PH_1__ it.",
      "sourceHash": "c70843a287adb9a4ad4251b95dfd01fa18fa1a5bd1a100906c5d303ddf9b705c",
      "context": "Evernote > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "dcfcf2808b5ee2971559adddd6e5eb1d98d7630e652566eced2b830aba3879da",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_117f44a4dc4b8143dd5318c5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When reporting such an issue make sure to provide the following information:",
      "sourceHash": "117f44a4dc4b8143dd5318c5b597fa66186e508727e871e34df7eba85bf269c6",
      "context": "Evernote > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "dcfcf2808b5ee2971559adddd6e5eb1d98d7630e652566eced2b830aba3879da",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_55aae98523768010fd9d2e42_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ export of the original note. This allows us to reproduce the issue.",
      "sourceHash": "55aae98523768010fd9d2e42f14cf8f3ea2e2c64c324ee7a38d42600d6999397",
      "context": "Evernote > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "dcfcf2808b5ee2971559adddd6e5eb1d98d7630e652566eced2b830aba3879da",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_58fc624abc1c8353c5d22832_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A screenshot with how it originally looked like before the import and how it looks after the import.",
      "sourceHash": "58fc624abc1c8353c5d228324200d67facbf52bca821c0d584468d92c22db7ef",
      "context": "Evernote > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "dcfcf2808b5ee2971559adddd6e5eb1d98d7630e652566eced2b830aba3879da",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    }
  ],
